 113:../../../core/drivers/octa-flash/src/octa-flash.c ****     * \param    aPageNr      The 256 byte page you want to start reading or writing from.
 114:../../../core/drivers/octa-flash/src/octa-flash.c ****     * \returns  0 if successful
 115:../../../core/drivers/octa-flash/src/octa-flash.c ****     * \returns  E_WRITE_IN_PROGRESS if the flash is performing a write action.
